  "about": {
    "section_tag": "Our Story",
    "section_headline": "Born on Wooster Street.",
    "ch1_eyebrow": "THE BEGINNING",
    "ch1_headline": "Born on Wooster Street.",
    "ch1_body": "It started with a simple belief — that great food doesn't need a fancy dining room. Just the right wood, the right fire, and the right people at the table. Wooster Street Food Company was built on that idea, and every dish we make still honors it.",
    "ch2_eyebrow": "THE CRAFT",
    "ch2_headline": "Every Detail Matters.",
    "ch2_body": "Our kitchen is obsessed with craft. We source locally wherever we can, roll every dough by hand, and never rush a sauce. Whether it's a 12\" apizza or a full catering spread, the standard is the same: if it doesn't taste exactly right, it doesn't leave the kitchen.",
    "ch3_eyebrow": "THE NUMBERS",
    "ch3_headline": "The Results Speak.",
    "ch3_body": "Real numbers from real customers. Our 4.4-star DoorDash rating, 1,129+ Yelp reviews, and 8.0/10 One Bite score are the direct result of holding ourselves to a standard that doesn't move.",
    "ch4_eyebrow": "THE FUTURE",
    "ch4_headline": "Still Hungry.",
    "ch4_body": "The fire never goes out. We're always working on something new — new specials, new catering packages, new ways to bring Wooster Street flavor to more tables. Follow us on Instagram to keep up."
  },
